[h1]Less Map Markers 0.1.0[/h1]

[list]
[*]Added the initial Steam Workshop package for Less Map Markers.
[*]Added workshop metadata and thumbnail assets.
[*]Lowers the quality and detail of map markers to improve performance.
[*]Keeps your own important markers visible while hiding many foreign markers.
[*]Construction markers are simplified but still keep the correct icon and progress ring.
[*]Removed the copied starter event scaffold so the mod does not change gameplay scripts.
[/list]
